=== Episode 2: Bread ===
For the signature bake, the bakers were required to make 12 [[flatbreads]], 6 with yeast and 6 without, in {{frac|2|1|2}} hours. For the technical challenge, they had to make an eight-strand plaited (braided) loaf in 2 hours, using Paul Hollywood's recipe. For the showstopper bake, the bakers were given 4 hours to make 24 [[bagel]]s: 12 sweet and 12 savoury.

