=== Episode 5: Pies ===
The signature bake was [[Beef Wellington|Wellington]], which Paul specified should be at least 8 inches long and completely covered with pastry. The bakers were given 3 hours for the challenge. The technical challenge was to make a [[Raised pie|hand-raised pie]] in 2<sup>1</sup>⁄<sub>4</sub> hours. This was to be made with a [[Hot water crust pastry|hot water crust]] and moulded using a dolly. The pie was left to set overnight and judged the next day. For the showstopper challenge, the bakers were required to bake a family-sized sweet American-style pie in 3<sup>1</sup>⁄<sub>2</sub> hours.

