=== Episode 7: Sweet Dough ===
For the signature bake, the bakers were set to bake 24 [[buns]] made from an enriched dough with yeast in 3 hours. The buns should be all of the same size and evenly baked. For the technical bake, the bakers were challenged to make 10 [[jam doughnut]]s, using Paul Hollywood's recipe, in 2<sup>1</sup>⁄<sub>2</sub> hours. They should be consistent in size, shape, jam distribution, and colour. For the showstopper, the bakers each made a celebratory enriched-dough loaf. This challenge started straight after the technical bake, so that the dough could be [[Proofing (baking technique)|proofed]] overnight if necessary.

