=== Episode 9: Pâtisserie (Semifinal) ===
For the first [[pâtisserie]] test, the bakers were required to make 3 types of [[petits fours]], 12 of each. These should be small (each a single mouthful), exquisite and perfect. Mary set the bakers to make a Fraisier cake for the technical challenge to be done in 2<sup>1</sup>⁄<sub>2</sub> hours. [[Choux pastry]] [[gateau]] was set as the showstopper.

