=== Episode 10: Final ===
The finalists were set the task of making a savoury [[pithivier]] in 2<sup>1</sup>⁄<sub>2</sub> hours. Paul and Mary's technical challenge required 25 [[French Fancies|fondant fancies]] to be done in 2<sup>1</sup>⁄<sub>2</sub>hours. For the final showstopper, the finalists were required to make, in 4 hours, a [[chiffon cake]] based on the theme of their personal highlights of 2012. All the bakes were served at a special summer fête held on the ground of [[Harptree Court]].

